OL,3,AWhat books had people turning pages and
OL,4,Aturning up the volume this year?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThrillers, self-help books and Harry
OL,7,FPotter were among the favourites for
OL,8,Freaders in Northern Ireland this year,
OL,9,Faccording to Libraries NI.
OL,11,FFor those who prefered to listen to
OL,12,Ftheir fiction, Freida McFadden had
OL,13,Feight of her titles featuring in the
OL,14,Ftop 10 adult fiction audiobooks
OL,15,Fborrowed.
OL,17,FJillian McFrederick from Libraries NI
OL,18,Fsaid books with "short chapters" and
OL,19,F"catchy, racy" themes seemed to be most
OL,20,Fpopular.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
