OL,3,AWhat books had people turning pages and
OL,4,Aturning up the volume this year?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut when it came to younger readers,
OL,7,Fthere was little change with Harry
OL,8,FPotter continuing to be popular -
OL,9,Falmost 30 years after the release of
OL,10,Fthe first book.
